&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="as-sete-decisões-registradas"&gt;As sete decisões registradas&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="as-sete-decisões-registradas"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#as-sete-decis%c3%b5es-registradas" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente para esta secção"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As decisões que o resto do código assume, cada uma num ADR do repositório. São o roteiro natural da entrevista.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;ADR&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Assunto&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Em uma linha&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Carolbalbs/obraflow-case/blob/resolucao-obraflow/docs/adr/0001-cadeia-de-aprovacao-e-snapshot.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;0001&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Cadeia é snapshot&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Gravada na submissão, nunca recalculada&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Carolbalbs/obraflow-case/blob/resolucao-obraflow/docs/adr/0002-faixa-por-limite-superior.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;0002&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Só o limite superior&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Buraco e sobreposição deixam de ser representáveis&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Carolbalbs/obraflow-case/blob/resolucao-obraflow/docs/adr/0003-route-handlers-sem-server-actions.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;0003&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Route Handlers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;O contrato precisa ser inspecionável por &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Carolbalbs/obraflow-case/blob/resolucao-obraflow/docs/adr/0004-decisao-por-update-condicional.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;0004&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;UPDATE&lt;/code&gt; condicional&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Fora de ordem, duplo clique e corrida, um mecanismo só&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Carolbalbs/obraflow-case/blob/resolucao-obraflow/docs/adr/0005-sessao-de-demonstracao-sem-senha.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;0005&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Sessão sem senha&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Atrás de &lt;code&gt;DEMO_MODE&lt;/code&gt;; desligada, 404 e não 403&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Carolbalbs/obraflow-case/blob/resolucao-obraflow/docs/adr/0006-sem-empresa-no-modelo.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;0006&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Sem &lt;code&gt;Empresa&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Obra&lt;/code&gt; é o escopo máximo&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Carolbalbs/obraflow-case/blob/resolucao-obraflow/docs/adr/0007-dominio-em-portugues.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;0007&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Domínio em português&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;O código fala a língua de quem usa o produto&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>